#
# A manifest that declares NEITHER `mf:entries` NOR `mf:include`. It parses, it
# types itself `mf:Manifest`, and it contributes nothing. `manifest::load` must
# refuse it: a manifest that loads clean and runs no case reports success while
# measuring nothing, which is exactly the silent green the loader's completeness
# guards exist to make impossible.
@prefix mf: <http://www.w3.org/2001/sw/DataAccess/tests/test-manifest#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<> a mf:Manifest ;
    rdfs:label "declares no entries and no includes" .
